{"title":"스즈메","artist":"노다 요지로","sourceId":"reference:NLVYrdB5ie5MVaeZwV9z","sourceHash":"dc25d402cca02e484adfe87849bcd62f8cb66326b080bdd961d2cc89d478b653","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":20503003,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.97,"end":7.22,"text":"ル・ル・ルルルルル・ルルル・ルルルルルル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":7.22,"end":13.33,"text":"ル・ル・ルルルルル・ルルル・ルルルルルル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":13.33,"end":19.42,"text":"ル・ル・ルルルルル・ルルル・ルルルルルル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":19.42,"end":26.25,"text":"ル・ル・ルルルルル・ルルル・ルルルルルル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":37.81,"end":44.19,"text":"君の中にある 赤と青き線","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":44.19,"end":50.21,"text":"それらが結ばれるのは 心の臓","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":50.21,"end":56.53,"text":"風の中でも負けないような声で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":56.53,"end":62.17,"text":"届る言葉を今は育ててる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":62.17,"end":64.95,"text":"時はまくらぎ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":64.95,"end":68.02,"text":"風はにきはだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":68.02,"end":71.02,"text":"星はうぶすな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":71.02,"end":74.98,"text":"人はかげろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":74.98,"end":81.19,"text":"なんで泣いてるのと聞かれ答えれる 涙なんかじゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":81.19,"end":87.1,"text":"僕ら出逢えたことの意味にはまるで 追いつかない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":87.1,"end":93.33,"text":"この身ひとつ じゃ足りない叫び","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":93.33,"end":99.46000000000001,"text":"君の手に触れた時にだけ震えた 心があったよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":99.46000000000001,"end":105.56,"text":"意味をいくつ越えれば僕らは辿り つけるのかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":105.56,"end":111.69,"text":"愚かさでいい 醜さでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":111.69,"end":120.28,"text":"正しさのその先で 君と手を取りたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":130.02,"end":136.28,"text":"思い出せない 大切な記憶","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":136.28,"end":142.19,"text":"言葉にならない ここにある想い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":142.19,"end":148.46,"text":"もしかしたら もしかしたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":148.46,"end":154.43,"text":"それだけでこの心はできてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":154.43,"end":160.73,"text":"もしかしたら もしかしたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":160.73,"end":166.74,"text":"君に「気づいて」と今もその胸を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":166.74,"end":170.32,"text":"打ち鳴らす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":183.77,"end":190.25,"text":"なんで泣いてるのと聞かれ答えれる 涙なんかじゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":190.25,"end":196.69,"text":"僕ら出逢えたことの意味にはまるで 追いつかない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":196.69,"end":202.68,"text":"この身ひとつ じゃ足りない叫び","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":202.68,"end":208.93,"text":"君の手に触れた時にだけ震えた 心があったよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":208.93,"end":215.06,"text":"意味をいくつ越えれば僕らは辿り つけるのかな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":215.06,"end":220.9,"text":"愚かさでいい 醜さでいい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":220.9,"end":227.72,"text":"正しさのその先で 君と生きてきたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}